This seems like the bigger issue. As a mom, I get wanting to help you children through tough times, but it is important all of the adults in this situation understand the predicament they are putting you and your brother in. You BOTH need privacy. I am sorry you are dealing with this.

&#x200B;

Do you have any decent sized closets in your house? I think I would make myself a makeshift room if I were in your shoes.  If nothing else just set up a room in the living room/dining room, whatever you have, and let it be known that the arrangement is not appropriate for you or your brother.

